### TESTE 1: CPF Válido (111.444.777-35) - Deve ACEITAR
POST http://localhost:3000/user/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João da Silva",
  "cpf": "11144477735",
  "email": "joao.silva@test.com",
  "password": "senha123",
  "type": "DIRECTOR",
  "status": "ATIVO",
  "birthDate": "1990-03-15T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### TESTE 2: CPF Válido (000.000.001-91) - Deve ACEITAR
POST http://localhost:3000/user/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Santos",
  "cpf": "00000000191",
  "email": "maria.santos@test.com",
  "password": "senha456",
  "type": "DIRECTOR",
  "status": "ATIVO",
  "birthDate": "1985-07-20T00:00:00.000Z"
}

